<title>JAPAN: Japan February crude oil import statistics - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan February crude oil import statistics - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) on Tuesday issued the following data on crude oil imports during February 1997:</p>
<p> CRUDE OIL   (1,000 kl) (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Iran	   3,324	 20,908    +44.0    +29.0</p>
<p> Iraq	     295	  1,856    -----    -----</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 4,714	 29,651    -10.7     +8.3</p>
<p> Kuwait	 1,383	  8,699    -16.0    +15.0</p>
<p> Neutral Zone   978	  6,152    -28.8    +10.6</p>
<p> Qatar	  1,614	 10,152    +39.4    +15.9</p>
<p> Oman	   1,180	  7,422    -19.7    -14.5</p>
<p> UAE	    5,693	 35,809    - 22.2   + 3.8</p>
<p> Yemen	    143	    899    ------   -69.9</p>
<p> China	  1,121	  7,051    + 12.6   + 1.8</p>
<p> Malaysia	 303	  1,906    - 40.5   -54.9</p>
<p> Brunei	   283	  1,780    +244.1   +62.4</p>
<p> Indonesia    1,319	  8,297    -  2.1   -25.9</p>
<p> Vietnam	  441	  2,774    + 37.5   +24.3</p>
<p> Mexico	   130	    818    -  0.6   -52.3</p>
<p> Gabon	    130	    818    ------   -----</p>
<p> Australia	172	  1,082    - 18.2   - 9.5</p>
<p> TOTAL	 23,223	146,073    -  4.5   + 3.7</p>
<p>(Figures may not tally due to rounding off)</p>
